      "body": "## Motivation\n\nFix the tile-sharding test failure tracked as T7 in #42752. `_free_port()` closes its socket before the three workers initialize their TCP rendezvous, leaving a window for another process to take the port.\n\n## Modifications\n\nUse a fresh `FileStore` in a temporary directory shared by the spawned workers. Keep the directory alive until `mp.spawn(..., join=True)` finishes. The Gloo collectives and decode assertions are unchanged.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nCPU-only Linux, PyTorch 2.11.0+cu130 with CUDA hidden; real three-rank Gloo:\n- Baseline and candidate: the same eight selected methods passed.\n- Hold the selected legacy port open between selection and worker startup: baseline fails with `EADDRINUSE`; candidate passes without using that rendezvous port.\n\nThese checks used commit-bound exports of the relevant production functions/classes and unchanged test methods, with an import adapter to avoid installing the full SGLang/Diffusers stack. They do not qualify full-package imports or official CI. Syntax and `git diff --check` pass; full pre-commit was not run. No GPU/model run. AI-assisted change and validation.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nN/A: test rendezvous only; no inference or performance change.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] Full pre-commit hooks (not run).\n- [x] Existing distributed test updated; selected native CPU checks described above.\n- [x] Documentation and model accuracy/speed benchmarks: not applicable.\n\n## Review and Merge Process\n\nPlease review the test-only rendezvous change and run the official tile-sharding unit test in CI.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #38733091209](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38733091209)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38733091259](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38733091259)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38733090034](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38733090034)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
